WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.100
Efficiency is the useful energy out divided by the total energy in.

2
00:00:06.151 --> 00:00:10.276
A filament bulb takes in one hundred joules of electrical energy.

3
00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:16.003
Only ten joules come out as light. Ninety joules become heat.

4
00:00:16.554 --> 00:00:21.779
Efficiency is ten out of a hundred: ten percent. An LED is about forty.
